<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fix Home - On Demand Home Services</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #f8fafc; color: #333; }
        header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 15px; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .logo { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: bold; color: #2563eb; }
        .btn-nav { background: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .hero { text-align: center; padding: 40px 15px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a, #2563eb); color: white; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .hero p { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 20px; opacity: 0.9; }
        .services { padding: 30px 15px; text-align: center; }
        .service-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 15px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .card { background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
        .booking { background-color: #e2e8f0; padding: 30px 15px; text-align: center; }
        .booking form { max-width: 100%; margin-top: 15px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
        .booking input, .booking select, .booking button { padding: 12px; border-radius: 5px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 1rem; }
        .booking button { background: #2563eb; color: white; border: none; font-weight: bold; }
        footer { text-align: center; padding: 15px; background: #0f172a; color: white; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="logo">🛠️ Fix Home</div>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-nav">Book Now</a>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Ghar Ki Har Problem Ka Perfect Solution</h1>
        <p>Expert Plumbers, Electricians & AC Mechanics at your doorstep.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
        <h2>Our Services</h2>
        <div class="service-grid">
            <div class="card"><h3>⚡ Electrician</h3><p>Wiring, switch repair & fitting.</p></div>
            <div class="card"><h3>🔧 Plumbing</h3><p>Tap leakage & pipe fittings.</p></div>
            <div class="card"><h3>❄️ AC Repair</h3><p>Gas filling & service.</p></div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="booking">
        <h2>Book a Service</h2>
        <form>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
            <input type="tel" placeholder="Mobile Number" required>
            <select required>
                <option value="">Select Service</option>
                <option value="electrician">Electrician</option>
                <option value="plumber">Plumber</option>
                <option value="ac">AC Service</option>
            </select>
            <button type="submit">Submit Request</button>
        </form>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Fix Home. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
